    <main class="main mb-5" data-asc="8106" id="skipto">
        <div class="container">
                <h1 class="mainTitle msg">2026 Candidates for Office</h1>
            <div class="row align-items-start">
                <section class="col-12 col-lg-8">
                        <div class="overview">
                            <div class="tXl">
                                <div>
                                  
                                    
<p>Where there is no address listed, it has been obscured at the candidate's request per Utah Code 63G-2-305.</p>
<p>Additional candidate information can be found on the State of Utah's website.</p>
<p>Candidates for U.S. House of Representatives will file for office in March.</p>
                                </div>
        

                               
                                

