<div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
    
    <p>Filter candidates by race or political party, or search for individual candidates. To search individually, do a free text search or select a candidate from the drop-down menu to view their information.</p>
    <p class="visually-hidden">Use heading level 3 to browse through each of the races available, and heading level 4 to browse through the candidates per race. </p>
</div>
